</style></head><body class="tool-page"><nav class="pilot-nav"><a href="__VIEWER__/tools.html">Under Glass / Tools</a><a href="summary.json">Summary</a><button class="theme led" data-theme-toggle aria-pressed="false">Dark mode</button></nav>
<main><header class="tool-head"><div><span class="label">Penny · Pam · Gus / Actual recordings</span><h1>An evening together?</h1><p>History can open a possibility. An agreement still has to become a shared evening.</p></div></header>
<div class="controls"><label>Recording <select id="run"></select></label><label>Person <select id="person"><option value="">Everyone</option><option>Penny</option><option>Pam</option><option>Gus</option></select></label><label>Ending <select id="ending"><option value="">All endings</option></select></label></div>
<dl class="metric-grid" id="metrics"></dl>
<section class="panel"><div class="row"><h2 id="run-title"></h2><span class="spacer"></span><a id="chain-viewer">Follow in Life chains →</a><a id="run-viewer">Run Viewer →</a><a id="raw">JSON</a></div><p class="muted small" id="run-method"></p><div class="row small" id="model-summary"></div><div class="row legend"><span class="good">● Shared time</span><span class="bad">● Declined / interrupted / missed</span><span class="waiting">● Waiting / not now</span></div><div id="episodes"></div><details class="receipt"><summary>Other choices and responses</summary><div id="unplanned"></div></details></section>
