<details class="panel"><summary>The same choice, with one history removed <span class="muted small" id="comparison-count"></span></summary><p class="muted small">The scene, other records and random draw stay fixed. These compare authored weights; they do not predict Laya’s answer or another life.</p><div id="comparisons"></div></details>
<details class="panel"><summary>Starting histories and their sources</summary><p class="muted small">Only the displayed admitted readings seed a feeling or expectation. A history’s wording and its numerical effect are separate.</p><div class="history-grid" id="histories"></div><a href="history.json">Full reviewed history pack →</a></details>
<details class="panel"><summary>Method, replay and limits</summary><p id="matrix" class="small"></p><div id="verification"></div><p class="small muted">All fixed seeds are retained, including quiet runs. Separate authored and Laya runs may diverge after a different choice. A remembered feeling, model suggestion or missed evening never proves where an absent person went or why. Life chains displays these experimental plan records; the ordinary Run Viewer shows the surrounding town.</p><details class="receipt"><summary>Full trial summary</summary><pre id="summary"></pre></details></details>
